            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Niêu An Nhiên",
            "review_text": "Jake B\n2 contributions\n0\nMaggot chips\nJun 2025 • Friends\nI don’t ever write reviews but I had to after this. Had chips that came with maggots in them and fried chicken noodles that were clearly packet noodles. The noodles were undercooked and crunchy. \nWhen I went and showed the waitress the maggot in my food she laughed which is not a joking matter. \n\nHowever there was one lovely waitress there that took my chips off the bill and she was very apologetic.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 14, 2025",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
