            "review_text": "Wsea3h\nAsia4514 contributions\n0\nGood taste. Too big dishes for 2 persons\nJan 2023\nThe taste is quite good and price is reasonable. I wish they could cook smaller dishes. We ordered only 2 types of main dishes and 1 vegetable soup and couldn’t finish the pork. The chair setting is low chairs in relaxing mode. This restaurant is suitable for families and friends. We came early before normal dinner time in Ha Giang so most of the eateries didn’t open yet. Luckily we found this restaurant. The rice is a bit dry to our liking but tastes good and smells good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 17, 2023",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
